# DESCRIPTION		: This script gets the input from denommn005.jsp
#  			  and performs same currency exchange
# MENU OPTION		: HCASHX
# CALLING JSP		: denommn005.jsp
# AUTHOR		: Sandeep Patil
# MODULE CODE		: DENOM
